    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quintus-dĕcĭmus</span></b> , a, um,
			num. adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the fifteenth</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Inv. 1, 54, 105</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quintisdecimis castris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					45, 33 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in libro quintodecimo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 16, 11</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">often separately: quinto decimo Kal. Dec.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 88</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and sometimes in reverse order: anno decimo
					quinto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Eutr. 1, 19</span></i>
			.</div>
